# 3AM
v1.0.0-stable

# First Stable Release
This marks the first stable release of 3AM after a little over 62 hours of work in!

## What's Up?

### 🚀 Optimizations & Performance
- Slashed app opening times by over 50% by optimizing animations and reducing HeartEngine's scan time.
- Heavy UI Refactoring: Conducted a massive structural cleanup app-wide, resulting in a leaner yet fulfilling experience.
- APK Shrinking: Enabled full R8 code shrinking and obfuscation.
- Smart Polling: Dialed back the widget and notification polling rate from 500ms to a more friendly 1000ms.

### 🤝 Data & Privacy
- Local Only: The app relies on local files, and no data is sent or received to the cloud.
- Statistics: The app collects listening times and other playback data to display statistics, all stored and processed locally.


### 🌐Web
- Initial minimal Next.js based website.
- Github Pages Integration: For hosting deployments.
- Downloads: Handling all downloads and redirecting to releases from the website